WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.634
Managers review their staff.

2
00:00:02.654 --> 00:00:06.630
For a solo founder, fifteen minutes on Friday is enough.

3
00:00:06.666 --> 00:00:08.244
Here's the routine.

4
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.105
First, read the log.

5
00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:12.755
Duet keeps its updates in one thread.

6
00:00:12.775 --> 00:00:15.205
Dots show their work in Activity.

7
00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:19.246
Grok Bots show proposals and approvals in the conversation.

8
00:00:19.309 --> 00:00:24.562
Second, count misses: wrong drafts, missed urgent items and false alarms.

9
00:00:24.629 --> 00:00:31.743
Third, change one thing: tighten a rule, add an example to the brief, or remove an app it doesn't need.

10
00:00:31.785 --> 00:00:37.082
Fourth, prune: pause stale routines, and cancel any plan nobody used.

11
00:00:37.107 --> 00:00:39.000
Then decide on trust.

12
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.880
After four clean weeks, an agent can move from drafts to a narrow action, like filing receipts.

13
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:49.063
If it repeats a mistake, change the brief once.

14
00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:51.900
If it still fails, remove the role.

15
00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:55.170
Customer sends and money stay behind your click.

16
00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:58.053
In the exercise, you'll draw your own chart.

